{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53375","headline":"次韵答阳刺史城 · 何坚","name":"次韵答阳刺史城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素履衡门秉直忠，挂冠金阙回江东。\n戢羽应知非健翮，守雌或可谓知雄。\n午夜鸣琴餐玄露，深山弄月友赤松。\n多感君侯欢导引，临流遣兴醉碧筒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}